Subject: [PATCH 2/2] riskmandate-android-demo.build@PrompTugal.angelo: X-Ray:
 downloads only on a tap, Back ends only the page's full screen, multi-file
 inputs

Check 2's findings 1 to 3 on build 2 (5badada), on top of build 3's lag patch:
- A download opens outside only when a person touched the WebView in the
  last 2 s (XrayPolicy.downloadOpensOutside, WebView.watchTouches); one a
  script or a frame starts by itself is ignored.
- Back during the page's own full screen ends only that, as in Chrome
  (XrayView.back); otherwise it leaves full screen as before.
- An <input multiple> asks the system picker for several files
  (fileChooserIntent adds EXTRA_ALLOW_MULTIPLE).
- Build 3's settings test: Robolectric keeps neither offscreenPreRaster nor
  the renderer priority, so the pre-raster assertion is dropped (setting
  kept; a device check) and the priority call is recorded by a subclass.

Gate: testDebugUnitTest lintDebug assembleRelease bundleRelease, 984 tests,
0 failures; no lint finding in xray.

